<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-19T03:43:48.459Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 03:43:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have redeployed to Jurf al-Nasr and Jurf al-Sakhar to confront Kataib Hezbollah and enforce a crackdown on oil smuggling, while Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has threatened forceful removal of the militia. An IRGC commander arrived in Iraq for talks amid rising tensions with Kataib Hezbollah, and Iran-backed militia members tortured an environmental activist protecting marshes. Iraqi fighter jets struck ISIS remnants in Anbar province, conducting two airstrikes against the group. The government ordered security steps for the Jurf al-Sakhar oil pipeline and referred pipeline violations to the judiciary. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQeE81RHNyWV9Jc2dPbDFQR29pcEhYZlJCc1JFR1JsT1ctM2h2MG1aaEJ0dGk3a3VobmtWYzMtWW45ZGNPaXF0YlFUbDQzMUZpRmVONzBsY2M1SS04b0VZVnZ3V2N6S0l4UC03MWRkSVdGWVN2czdYTWxab1phZC0wa2k1RHJLTTBHM2Jla1BpVW4tQkdUdWR1QWdkWlI3ZEVCQnozOS1HUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOZmZUaEpxcXZUakJxOWFTMUNoVjJlVUxMMnltZVRiaDRpc0w5SzFDYnpNNW9aaXlxcWk4T21QRlJmaTlhUktGTVlPd05uSjgxVW9tdWRkelhzV1l3WUhPQjJzWDhmblNwNFJUVjF1VFJnQ3hpVHV0VGpwNW52aEtnY3JvanZlZHZqWGZCZTJUSXh4Y3BwX2cyd1FIb0Zoajh1aG04amlPS0ZqUlFSaEtvTW16NXZfdmtIdmIzSGNPelhXY0FvaWMzV3Fxbkk?oc=5&quot;&gt;アラブニュース&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNRDc5WllheDYwWGd0RE82NjRLVkw0anBmTG1KTUxVdDNhdE9DeWdZTThaSUU3aGJvNHM5VnBVSlYwWlVsbEUyeDEwZll